  "description": "Always-on, on-device DEFENSIVE immune system for Circle AI. A network/threat\n      monitor that shields the user by matching outbound/inbound network observations\n      (dialed IPs, DNS lookups, TLS SNI) against a bundled, offline, refreshable\n      indicator blocklist (known-bad IPv4/IPv6 addresses, CIDR ranges and domains)\n      and by flagging connection anomalies (scan fan-out, connection floods, C2\n      beaconing). Autonomic — started at boot, never user-launched.\n\n      Complements CircleAI.Security (peer trust + local runtime immune system): the\n      optional WatchdogThreatSink forwards confirmed network threats into the existing\n      ISecurityWatchdog. Pairs with Panik/Nope SOS via the ISosEscalation seam.\n      100% offline (blocklist bundled as an EmbeddedResource), de-Googled, low-end\n      Android friendly (synchronous, allocation-light hot path; no cloud, no GMS).",
